7. Conclusion

The SaaS-based attendance management system provides an efficient and modern solution for managing student attendance. It reduces manual work, saves time, and allows faculty members and students to access attendance records from anywhere.

By implementing cloud-based technology, the college can improve accuracy, accessibility, and overall attendance management.
